{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"tests/unit/_opcert_helpers.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/_opcert_helpers.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/_opcert_helpers.py#D:<module>\tOption B fixtures build a tickets-branch store whose ordered log positions support storage-anchor key-era validation.\tPASS\t71\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/_opcert_helpers.py#D:store_with_chain\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/_opcert_helpers.py#D:store_with_chain\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/_opcert_helpers.py#D:store_with_chain\tThe helper returns repository, tracker, and oldest-first ``(log_position, commit)`` pairs suitable for key-era starts and later storage anchors.\tPASS\t61\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/conftest.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/conftest.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/conftest.py#D:<module>\tUnit configuration exposes engine helpers and reconciler compatibility shims through the same ``rebar.*`` packages used by the library.\tPASS\t72\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/conftest.py#D:_no_real_session_log_writes\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/conftest.py#D:_no_real_session_log_writes\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/conftest.py#D:_no_real_session_log_writes\tThe autouse fixture prevents indirect degraded-gate telemetry from writing session logs or the current-log pointer while allowing function-scoped overrides.\tPASS\t152\t45\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/conftest.py#D:_isolated_mcp_client_home\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/conftest.py#D:_isolated_mcp_client_home\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/conftest.py#D:_isolated_mcp_client_home\tImplicit ``doctor_cli`` MCP scans use the empty fixture home while explicit homes, ``$HOME``, and other home-derived resources remain untouched.\tPASS\t188\t39\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/conftest.py#D:_isolated_aws_provider_credentials\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/conftest.py#D:_isolated_aws_provider_credentials\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/conftest.py#D:_isolated_aws_provider_credentials\tBedrock tests use empty AWS config and credential files with ambient profile selectors removed while region and ``$HOME`` remain unchanged and test overrides still win.\tPASS\t260\t52\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/conftest.py#C:<module>:before:_ENGINE_PKG_DIR\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/conftest.py#C:<module>:before:_ENGINE_PKG_DIR\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/conftest.py#C:<module>:before:_ENGINE_PKG_DIR\tThe shadow package is seeded before the engine path and extended for every unit collection, preserving test-package precedence.\tPASS\t351\t34\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/conftest.py#C:_bridge_reconciler_shadow_package:before:_front\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/conftest.py#C:_bridge_reconciler_shadow_package:before:_front\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/conftest.py#C:_bridge_reconciler_shadow_package:before:_front\tThe shadow directory precedes the engine directory and unrelated search-path entries remain.\tPASS\t49\t23\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/gold_set_completion.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/gold_set_completion.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/gold_set_completion.py#D:<module>\tThe frozen corpus retains Pass 2 subanswers, delivery state, completion-floor labels, all keep/drop anchors, provenance categories, and both deterministic and calibration consumers.\tPASS\t185\t77\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#D:<module>\tReducer cache reads cross-check cached attestation keys against signed disk events, miss on disagreement, and agree with independent signature verification.\tPASS\t156\t56\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#C:test_reduce_reflects_ondisk_attestation_after_stale_cache:before:warm\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#C:test_reduce_reflects_ondisk_attestation_after_stale_cache:before:warm\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#C:test_reduce_reflects_ondisk_attestation_after_stale_cache:before:warm\tThe warm step writes a cache entry containing the signed attestation and matching directory hash.\tPASS\t26\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#C:test_reduce_reflects_ondisk_attestation_after_stale_cache:before:cache\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#C:test_reduce_reflects_ondisk_attestation_after_stale_cache:before:cache\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#C:test_reduce_reflects_ondisk_attestation_after_stale_cache:before:cache\tThe stale-cache setup removes only cached attestations while retaining the hash and signed disk event.\tPASS\t45\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#C:test_reduce_reflects_ondisk_attestation_after_stale_cache:before:state\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#C:test_reduce_reflects_ondisk_attestation_after_stale_cache:before:state\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py#C:test_reduce_reflects_ondisk_attestation_after_stale_cache:before:state\tThe final reduction detects the mismatch, rebuilds from disk, and matches signature verification.\tPASS\t32\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_a8e5_absence_veto_edge.py#D:test_f1fa_1144_false_absence_regression_fixture\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_a8e5_absence_veto_edge.py#D:test_f1fa_1144_false_absence_regression_fixture\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_a8e5_absence_veto_edge.py#D:test_f1fa_1144_false_absence_regression_fixture\tThe fixture retains the actor, pre-cutover snapshot, timing, absence-veto tuple, dropped false absence, and surviving confirmed-absence control.\tPASS\t67\t39\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_ac_satisfiability_criterion.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_ac_satisfiability_criterion.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_ac_satisfiability_criterion.py#D:<module>\tThe criterion covers contradictions within one ticket's acceptance criteria and remains distinct from coherence, mapping, and measurability checks.\tPASS\t89\t38\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_ac_satisfiability_criterion.py#D:test_routing_entry\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_ac_satisfiability_criterion.py#D:test_routing_entry\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_ac_satisfiability_criterion.py#D:test_routing_entry\tThe criterion remains advisory, coherence-faceted, single-turn, fixed-chunked, outside the per-plan agent budget, and promotion remains calibration-gated.\tPASS\t77\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_ac_satisfiability_criterion.py#D:test_reaches_pass1_and_attributes\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_ac_satisfiability_criterion.py#D:test_reaches_pass1_and_attributes\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_ac_satisfiability_criterion.py#D:test_reaches_pass1_and_attributes\tPass 1 receives the rubric and preserves correctly attributed findings while unknown IDs drop and judgment accuracy remains calibrated.\tPASS\t59\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_administrative_close_dispositions.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_administrative_close_dispositions.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_administrative_close_dispositions.py#D:<module>\tNon-bug administrative classes, reason and replacement-link requirements, verifier bypass, signed disposition manifest, and failure guidance remain specified.\tPASS\t180\t50\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_advanced_cli_parsers.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_advanced_cli_parsers.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_advanced_cli_parsers.py#D:<module>\tAdvanced parser factories preserve presentation passthroughs, ``RebarArgumentParser``, nested selection, lazy construction, help, error, alias, and registry contracts.\tPASS\t88\t49\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agent_call_memo_nudge.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agent_call_memo_nudge.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agent_call_memo_nudge.py#D:<module>\tFour read-only tools cache successes and stable empty results, nudge duplicate calls, retry errors and excluded tools, and preserve runaway-guard accounting and bounds.\tPASS\t139\t61\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agent_call_memo_nudge.py#C:<module>:before:def _file_backed_read_file\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agent_call_memo_nudge.py#C:<module>:before:def _file_backed_read_file\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agent_call_memo_nudge.py#C:<module>:before:def _file_backed_read_file\tPath-normalized ``read_file`` memoization performs one whole-file read and serves later ranges from cached text.\tPASS\t68\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agent_call_runaway_guard_c827.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agent_call_runaway_guard_c827.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agent_call_runaway_guard_c827.py#D:<module>\tA 24-call window with a ratio at most 0.50 raises and classifies ``RunawayToolLoopError``, routes request and tool-call limits through bounded recovery, preserves healthy breadth, and computes once per step.\tPASS\t83\t56\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agent_call_seam.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agent_call_seam.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agent_call_seam.py#D:<module>\tThe extracted seam preserves kwargs shape, tool-step filtering, omission of unused keys, regression coverage, and the single-sourced module-size limit.\tPASS\t122\t38\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agent_skill_ticket_workflow_guidance.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agent_skill_ticket_workflow_guidance.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agent_skill_ticket_workflow_guidance.py#D:<module>\tPackaged skill tests retain atomic-claim, plan-review, portable-assignee, and blocked-review guidance.\tPASS\t37\t23\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agentic_budget_and_truncation.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agentic_budget_and_truncation.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agentic_budget_and_truncation.py#D:<module>\tAgentic reviews retain 250 steps, ``cfg.max_tokens`` propagation, and unretryable handling for truncation, refusal, and content filtering without repeated output calls.\tPASS\t129\t42\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:<module>\tAnthropic caches after history with its existing breakpoints, Bedrock uses final-message ``cachePoint`` without top-level ``cache_control``, single-turn requests match frozen settings, and captures stop before network I/O.\tPASS\t312\t75\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:test_agentic_anthropic_adds_the_automatic_message_breakpoint\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:test_agentic_anthropic_adds_the_automatic_message_breakpoint\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:test_agentic_anthropic_adds_the_automatic_message_breakpoint\tAnthropic agentic settings retain system and tool breakpoints, add automatic history caching, and omit the conflicting message-cache option.\tPASS\t43\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:test_captured_agentic_request_carries_a_breakpoint_after_the_message_history\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:test_captured_agentic_request_carries_a_breakpoint_after_the_message_history\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:test_captured_agentic_request_carries_a_breakpoint_after_the_message_history\tThe captured Anthropic request contains top-level ``cache_control``, and same-run baseline capture excludes the preexisting breakpoints as the cause.\tPASS\t71\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:test_the_anthropic_breakpoint_budget_is_not_exceeded_on_the_agentic_path\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:test_the_anthropic_breakpoint_budget_is_not_exceeded_on_the_agentic_path\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py#D:test_the_anthropic_breakpoint_budget_is_not_exceeded_on_the_agentic_path\tAnthropic assembly stays within three points through two explicit points and one automatic history point.\tPASS\t61\t30\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agents_claim_assignee_guidance.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agents_claim_assignee_guidance.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agents_claim_assignee_guidance.py#D:<module>\tAgents omit ``--assignee`` to use the configured default, and explicit Jira-resolvable email or ``accountId`` overrides avoid reconciliation clearing.\tPASS\t99\t38\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agents_serena_untyped_receiver.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agents_serena_untyped_receiver.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agents_serena_untyped_receiver.py#D:<module>\tThe Any-receiver blind spot, empty semantic result, three reproduced call sites, control symbol, and both guidance consumers remain.\tPASS\t140\t54\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_agents_serena_untyped_receiver.py#C:test_nav_doc_carries_the_untyped_receiver_reproduction:before:assert \"dispatch_one.py\" in doc\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_agents_serena_untyped_receiver.py#C:test_nav_doc_carries_the_untyped_receiver_reproduction:before:assert \"dispatch_one.py\" in doc\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_agents_serena_untyped_receiver.py#C:test_nav_doc_carries_the_untyped_receiver_reproduction:before:assert \"dispatch_one.py\" in doc\tThe three asserted files remain the concrete callers hidden from Serena's untyped-receiver lookup.\tPASS\t48\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py#D:<module>\tEvery alarm requires actions or the exact reasoned opt-out, host alarms treat missing data as breaching or use the exact reasoned marker, floors prevent vacuity, and checks stay offline.\tPASS\t258\t75\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py#D:_rendered_description\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py#D:_rendered_description\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py#D:_rendered_description\tHeredoc descriptions apply Terraform indentation semantics and remain checked against AWS's 1024-character limit.\tPASS\t47\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py#C:<module>:before:_MIN_EXPECTED_ALARMS\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py#C:<module>:before:_MIN_EXPECTED_ALARMS\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py#C:<module>:before:_MIN_EXPECTED_ALARMS\tThe alarm-count floor fails empty or incomplete parses and changes only with corresponding alarm additions or deletions.\tPASS\t74\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d\ntests/unit/test_amend_msg_change_id.py#D:<module>\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:tests/unit/test_amend_msg_change_id.py#D:<module>\t11d343ca749de0b00a1438eeffcb5e5f81dcabe812ebc4f75:tests/unit/test_amend_msg_change_id.py#D:<module>\tThe wrapper preserves Change-Id and sign-offs across replacement messages, respects supplied sign-offs, rejects unsafe inputs and fixed shared paths, and is contrasted from one base commit.\tPASS\t206\t77\tPASS\tPASS\tbotchy-roomy-acouchi/cea4-276c-40a8-474d"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788992538808247001,"uuid":"003da625-46e8-4341-b524-df35ca94d0a0"}